# OCIE: Oncology Competitive Intelligence Engine
#
# No environment variables are required. The dashboard runs entirely on
# committed data files in data/*.json. Just:
#
#   npm install
#   npm run dev
#
# Optional data refresh commands:
#   npm run data:validate               # validate model lookup tables
#   npm run data:refresh-benchmarks     # regenerate timeline benchmarks
#   npm run data:refresh-pipeline       # re-fetch pipeline data from ClinicalTrials.gov
